<span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F1.pic4" class="ltx_picture" height="1.8" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:3.25px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 21.17 1.8" width="21.17"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#4256A5;--ltx-fill-color:#4256A5;--ltx-fg-color:#4256A5;" color="#4256A5" fill="#4256A5" stroke="#4256A5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.3pt" transform="translate(0,1.8) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(0.9,0) translate(0,-3.25)"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 4.15 L 19.37 4.15"></path></g></svg></span> GRPO + PG-Sampling + LP-Weighting</p>
</div></div></div>
