<p id="S4.F3.2.1" class="ltx_p ltx_align_center">GRPO <span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S4.F3.pic2" class="ltx_picture" height="1.8" overflow="visible" style="vertical-align:3.25px" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 21.17 1.8" width="21.17"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#D6EECA;--ltx-fill-color:#D6EECA;--ltx-fg-color:#D6EECA;" color="#D6EECA" fill="#D6EECA" stroke="#D6EECA" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-width="1.3pt" transform="translate(0,1.8) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0) translate(0.9,0) translate(0,-3.25)"><path style="fill:none" d="M 0 4.15 L 19.37 4.15"></path></g></svg></span> GRPO + LP-Weighting 
