</figure>
</section>
<section id="S4.SS4.SSS0.Px6" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">LPPO under Diverse Scenarios.</h4>

<div id="S4.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">To verify that our LPPO generalises beyond the original
Qwen-2.5-Math-7B setup, we replicate RLVR training in three
orthogonal settings without retuning any hyper-parameters:
(i) a larger backbone with Qwen-2.5-14B,
(ii) a different backbone family using Llama-3.2-3B-Instruct,
and (iii) an alternative policy-gradient learner (REINFORCE++).
Table <a href="#S4.T4" title="Table 4 ‣ LPPO under Diverse Scenarios. ‣ 4.4 Experiment Analysis ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ From Data-Centric to Sample-Centric: Enhancing LLM Reasoning via Progressive Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> summarises the results, while per-benchmark
breakdowns are deferred to Appendix <a href="#A4" title="Appendix D LPPO under Diverse Scenarios ‣ From Data-Centric to Sample-Centric: Enhancing LLM Reasoning via Progressive Optimization" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">D</span></a>.
Across all variants, LPPO consistently yields <span id="S4.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text">+2–4 pp</span> absolute
improvements in <span id="S4.SS4.SSS0.Px6.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">pass@1</span>, demonstrating robustness to model scale,
backbone architecture, and RL optimiser choice.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T4" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S4.T4.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:172.5pt;height:25.7pt;vertical-align:-11.5pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-78.9pt,11.8pt) scale(0.522286585692633,0.522286585692633) ;">
<table id="S4.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tabular ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="S4.T4.2.1.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Setting</th>
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">Baseline</th>
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t">+LPPO</th>
<th id="S4.T4.2.1.1.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_t"><math id="S4.T4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta</annotation></semantics></math> (pp)</th></tr>
</thead>
